# Allowlist: never send local credentials, state, projects, tests or VCS to build.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!docker/
!docker/runtime-requirements.txt
!README.md
!LICENSE
!workspace_bridge/
!workspace_bridge/**
!web/
!web/**
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
# Stale checked-in frontend output: the builder always overwrites this with a
# fresh web-builder build, so excluding it keeps the context small and avoids
# invalidating COPY workspace_bridge/ on dist-only changes.
workspace_bridge/static/dist/
# Web files never COPYd by the Dockerfile build-inputs-only layer: excluding
# them keeps the context small (layer cache already ignores un-COPYd files).
web/tests/
web/test-results/
web/playwright.config.ts
web/README.md
web/.oxlintrc.json
workspace_bridge/**/__pycache__/
workspace_bridge/**/*.pyc
workspace_bridge/**/.env*
